'''Sand Bridge''' is a [[Spells|spell]] used to construct a bridge out of sand.

==Description==
The Casting Seal contains an additional ring, which is used to endow the primary spell with additional effects or stronger magic.{{Ref|a|8}}{{Ref|[[Writing/Translated Texts#EUINI'S_BOOK_1]]}} As with most spells, the effects are only temporary. While it is unknown exactly how long this spell lasts, it is presumably long enough to allow time for the manual construction of a new bridge in the meantime.{{Ref|m|12|26-27}} 

Within the inner ring, there is a single [[Sigils#Sand|Sigil of Sand]]. At the top and bottom of the seal lies a [[Signs#Immobility|Sign of Immobility]] in the middle of two [[Signs#Solidification|Signs of Solidification]]. This grouping of signs is found between two [[Signs#Strengthening|Signs of Strengthening]] and two small [[Signs#Partition|Signs of Partition]] facing outwards. Finally, two [[Signs#Columns|Signs of Columns]], a [[Signs#Binding|Sign of Binding]] and a [[Sigils#Bridging|Sigil of Bridging]] on either side of the seal complete the arrangement of signs in the outermost ring.{{Ref|[[Archives of Witch Hat Atelier]], Page 148}}

This spell manipulates abundant amounts of sand to rise and take shape as an arch bridge. It then hardens and remains in that shape until the magic wears off, now capable of supporting individuals' weights and any additional cargo they may be crossing with.

In [[Episode 8]], [[Olruggio]]'s Sand Bridge appears to manifest one pillar at a time for each Casting Seal drawn. In [[Chapter 33]], [[Agott]] uses the same spell to erect an entire arch bridge in front of her, albeit on a smaller scale than Olruggio's.{{Ref|a|8}}{{Ref|m|33|8-13}}
