==Trivia==
[[File:12 27 Sand Bridge Glyph.png|300px|thumb|<small>Chapter 12 Casting Seal</small>]]
* It is currently unclear why Agott's rendition of Sand Bridge manifests differently from Olruggio's.
* [[Episode 8]] provides a clearer look at the Casting Seal that originally appears in [[Chapter 12]]. Some recognizable elements include...
** A Sign of Columns in between two unknown signs. Based on the similarities in design and setup, this later becomes a Sign of Immoblity between two Signs of Solidification.
** Four Signs of Partition
** An additional ring
* Olruggio uses a [[Searneedle Wand]] to etch the Casting Seal onto a flat stone.{{Ref|m|12|26-27}}
